==Battleground==
*3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Aoshi Shinomori (Enemy)|Aoshi Shinomori]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.

